            "definition": "A person whose overall character and presence positively marked the session, recognized broadly across the fellowship — not just within one clique.",
            "disqualifiers": [
                "Popularity within one friend group",
                "Being loud, funny, or entertaining alone",
                "Visibility at events without character substance"
            ],
            "checklist": [
                "Active member this session",
                "Positive character demonstrated across 2 or more distinct, unconnected groups",
                "Specific examples given for each group, not general praise",
                "Corroborated by people from those different groups",
                "Consistency shown in how the nominee treats different kinds of people"
            ]
        },
